  ],
  "notes": "Not expressible: 'first available availability zone' (AZ comes from a data source; not pinned). 'Only rule allows egress to the VPC CIDR' is checked as a VPC-CIDR egress rule plus no 0.0.0.0/0 egress in the declared rules of the style the template uses (separate rules, inline egress, or VPC egress rules); a template mixing styles is judged on one of them, and ::/0 is not checked. 'No ingress by default' is checked on inline ingress only: a planned separate ingress rule cannot be excluded (exists needs min>=1). Region us-east-1 is not checked (the adapter plans every resource in us-east-1). Optional EBS volumes and ENIs are checked as declared and count/for_each-gated; the extra ENI's Elastic IP as a declared EIP linked to the declared ENI. PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says latest Ubuntu 22.04 AMI but the ground truth data.aws_ami filter is ubuntu-xenial-16.04; only an Ubuntu AMI lookup (data.aws_ami or SSM parameter) is checked. No real templates were available for candidate review."
}
